msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Přikaz, kiž ma so wuwjesć."

#: main.cpp:38
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken - not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Prawidłowny wuraz, kotremuž titl wokna wotpowěduje\n"
"Njeje-li ničo podate, wozmje so prěnje wokno.\n"
"To so njedoporučuje!"

#: main.cpp:41
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"The window id of the target window\n"
"Specifies the id of the window to use. If the id starts with 0x\n"
"it is assumed to be in hex."
msgstr ""
"Woknowy id ciloweho wokna.\n"
"Specifikuje id wokna, kiž ma os wužiwać. Započnje-li so id z 0x,\n"
"wobhladuje so jako heksadecimalna ličba."

#: main.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide the window to the tray on startup"
msgstr "Schowaj wokno při startowanju"

#: main.cpp:45
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"Wait until we are told to show the window before\n"
"executing the command"
msgstr ""
"Dočakaj, doniž nima so wokno pokazać, prjedy hač so\n"
"přikaz wuwjedźe"

#: main.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Sets the initial tooltip for the tray icon"
msgstr "Postaji spočatny tooltip za piktogram systemoweho pasa"

#: main.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Keep the tray icon even if the client exits. This option\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified."
msgstr ""
"Zdźerži piktogram systemoweho pasa, hdyž so klientowy program zakónči. \n"
"Tuta opcija so jenož wuskutkuje, hdyž je \"startonshow\" specifikowane."

#: main.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use ksystraycmd's icon instead of the window's icon in the systray\n"
"(should be used with --icon to specify ksystraycmd icon)"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Try to keep the window above other windows"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:53
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"Quit the client when we are told to hide the window.\n"
"This has no effect unless startonshow is specified and implies keeprunning."
msgstr ""
"Zakónči klientowy program, hdyž ma so wokno schować.\n"
"Wuskutkuje so jenož, hdyž so \"startonshow\" specifikuje a \"keeprunning\" "
"implikuje."

